    "image_with_text_PLTMEU": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "name": "Image with text",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/image_3_1.png",
        "image_position": "right",
        "image_width": 40,
        "title": "Why Choose Tiles Paradise UK",
        "content": "<h2>Why shop with Tiles Paradise?</h2><p>We buy our tiles and bathroom products straight from the factories and hold the whole range in our own UK warehouse. So even though it's imported, it's sitting on a shelf here ready to go, not weeks away on a container ship. No middleman adding a markup, no long waits just <a href=\"/collections/porcelain-tiles\">porcelain tiles</a> and <a href=\"/collections/premium-bathroom-tiles\">bathroom ranges</a> below high-street prices, ready for next-day delivery.</p><h3>Proper quality, minus the markup</h3><p>Dealing directly means you get the looks you'd normally pay a lot more for  <a href=\"/collections/marble-effect-tiles\">marble and onyx</a>, <a href=\"/collections/outdoor-tiles\">outdoor paving</a>, our own <a href=\"/collections/led-mirrors\">LED bathroom mirrors</a> — without the showroom price tag.</p><h3>UK stock, out the door fast</h3><p>Because everything's stocked here in the UK, most orders ship the next working day. Tiles are heavy and they chip easily, so they go out on a solid, fully-wrapped pallet that's built for the trip. And if something does turn up damaged, don't stress take a photo while it's still on the pallet, tell us within two working days, and we'll get a replacement out to you. The full details are on our <a href=\"/pages/shipping-policy\">delivery</a> and <a href=\"/pages/damages\">damages</a> pages.</p><h3>Not sure yet? Order a sample first</h3><p>A screen never quite shows how a tile really looks — the veining, the colour, the finish in your own light. So order a cut <a href=\"/pages/tile-sample-service\">sample</a>, have a proper look, and we'll take the cost off your order when you buy. What arrives is exactly what you pictured, with no nasty surprises.</p><h3>Real people, any time of day</h3><p>We're rated Excellent on <a href=\"https://uk.trustpilot.com/review/tilesparadiseuk.com\">Trustpilot</a>  — and every bathroom product comes with a guarantee. If you ever get stuck, there's a real person ready to help on live chat, WhatsApp or email, 24 hours a day, 7 days a week. Not bad going for a company that's only four years old. Have a browse through our <a href=\"/collections/best-sellers\">best sellers</a>, or <a href=\"/pages/who-we-are\">get to know us a bit better</a>.</p>",
        "button_text": "",
        "button_link": "shopify://collections/all",
        "custom_class": "home-image-text-sec"
      }
    },
